From 4788c46c1938cdd5ecf4006d02f9b59ca3319b4e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>
Date: Sat, 1 Aug 2026 01:18:49 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add jgen-only vector-bus path: council + speak without
 escalation

Introduces the JGEN vector bus architecture the product needs for
UI/vision memory: same-engine council and L2 speak, eternal-memory
recall, soft-token steer, and no AgentLoop/L3 Ollama escape hatch.

- New preset `jgen-vector-bus` (no escalation, execution backend=jgen)
- JGenSpeakAgent replaces AgentLoop when L2 is JGEN (stops MEM:check collapse)
- Council handoff: keep last consensus token, CJK-safe SoftSequence, no
  escalate nextAction when escalate is off; detail prompt without bracket tags
- applySetupProposal turns on executionUseJGEN for jgen execution layers
